{
  "$comment": "Who says which words in this chapter (docs/voice-narration-plan.md section 3). Drafted by `npm run voice:script`; a line with no entry is read by the narrator. A person checks each draft and sets `reviewed` to true; re-drafting only touches missing and stale entries.",
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/current/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:bf50dcc987e500b99eb14b9b7f7f84ec58c4b4c62703b897d24c04bad6f2bf1c",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The shelf is gone, and the Great River has you. It sweeps you along the east bank, below Frostfang. The cold squeezes like a big wet hug. The rope is still in your hands, with everyone on it. Overhead, a teal cape flaps."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I can't lift you all!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"So don't let go of each other! Find a way out, and I'll find you!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/stock/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:0c7c98e40ee384296b4023b75b519843c0fd3a3337b44d7514babcd44c7fdcad",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Everything happens at once. The river tugs you this way and that, like a dog with a favorite sock."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Count heads!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shouts."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Grab your packs! Breathe! Not in that order!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "What comes first?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/count/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:75d9646a7380d106eb8d9e99d8ced5ef89f39662d4037ecfd3303034f08b98a4",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Squeeze the rope twice, and the next hand squeezes back. Squeeze, squeeze. Every hand answers."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I count everyone!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls down."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I counted twice. I'm very good at counting.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/pack_grab/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:cbcc6e0d88821de635f4186fe71b42b9e8b304b458170d145411fd8164bc5764",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The packs bob along like fat, soggy ducks."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Left one!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry yells."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Your other left!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rally_breath/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:d4b2974300e9a8088120c69d84954f2a854506697cdf2c296ede0e66d9f1d231",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Rally lifts friends up, and everyone needs lifting. In, two, three, out. Panting turns into breathing."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Oh, that's nice,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry says, and breathes along up in the air."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/ride/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:ea493c69372220f7346ddb4462e7533888171bfa560f7aac4e6c4dbff8211188",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The east bank slides past, gray and steep. It looks close enough to kick for."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Don't fight it under the shelf!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"My mother always said: let it carry you, and watch where it curls!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Fight your way toward the bank, or float and learn the river?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/feet_first/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:b878dafc9037c0a141e1ccbf5e6fa97dacbce38e265f76aecbfcbdd24f93a9f1",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Feet first means you meet rocks with your boots, not your face."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Watch the ripples,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Where they curl, the water slows.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/kick_bank/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:36096535e1f254e012f41a0a1bac6bd28122d653a0bbb09d7897cf071886a6ad",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The bank looks so near. You kick hard."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Or that,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "sighs Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"That works too. Sometimes.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/floes/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:ad58168a18bd78bfb62a93358932aa319ea29b0c00cf02e91497a06483bab937",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Pieces of the broken shelf bob all around you, flat as tables, with corners sharp as rulers."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"That one has my boot marks on it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry cries."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"That was my road!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Some are big enough to climb on. How will you deal with them?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/push_floes/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:473afd01a28eefe34d536f5c53e37b269d5d6b052e5da8a01f93ac3a2a0a387a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A floe the size of a door slides toward your head."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Floe!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "yells Skerry, very usefully."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/climb_floe/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:f0aa0c29cdb9045f719dea444b4924f7613adadf6dd4995758bb97aaec650085",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A wide, flat floe floats beside you, like a raft that wants to help."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Up you go,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"All together, or it tips.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/smash_floe/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:2386a6347754066e312efb9e3df448de7c2a40ae71e3f64068d3ca6008a2bafa",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A floe as big as a barn door heads for the line."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Hit it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shouts."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Politely!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/floe_rest/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:866a0ad7881958e112cd1e077f7851699713f8a361c78efccff0560e774d7570",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The big floe holds still long enough to lie flat and breathe. On your pack, the Listening Chime swings on its cord. The whole river runs downhill, but the chime leans the other way: upstream, back toward the glacier."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Is it meant to do that?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls. For one minute, the river is only a bumpy road. How will you use it?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/floe_warm/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:b832993c97085b89b33f941d4e35914610b05de3845b4e58407b55e58d3f3d35",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You huddle in a wet, shivering heap. Slowly, the heap gets less shivery."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Very cozy,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry says from above."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'm a little jealous.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/floe_look/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:535098d94c44aca07399ffb51083e016ae893015c1e1dc52e4e36ced586d875f",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Past a bend, a dark, thumb-shaped ledge sticks into the river, with a round knob on its tip."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"See it?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"There's a goat path up from there!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Now you know to look for it."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/snag/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:b07ce1ae0a9173e9297e25a3d1dd8b9d40c452b9aaedda4fa2be65b687699d45",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The rope jerks short. Under the water, it has hooked on a stump of ice. The floe swings in a slow circle."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Don't untie!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shrieks."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Whatever you do, nobody untie!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "What now?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/unhook/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:94ace013128418b0420f790e1e7599bd5283bda33505d83ee358d86919dfca0d",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The line is stuck fast on the stump."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Pull!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry, who cannot reach it, very firmly."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/loop_tie/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:7ec0c517e8ac8ea1e0a9fc8013b03f5fb1ec915a55c920a68cf883aa21508205",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A big loop is a clever tool. You can throw it, hook it or hang from it."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Ooh,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Make it a ring-sized one.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/arch/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:45593157cd66edc448c4616b470eaa92d776b356eeb99d0e5bbb0237ba17a45a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The river dives under an arch of white ice, like a tunnel for giants."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll meet you on the other side!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls, and flaps up over the top. Inside, the water sounds hollow and loud. Somebody says,"
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Wow.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "\"Wow, wow, wow,\" says the arch. The roof is low in the middle. How will you get under?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/arch_flat/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:83974df9e3b984927fe199e3ea6874ee9f7da5a2a36cb6e849f7a43b57772616",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The roof comes down to a hand's width above the water."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Noses up,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "somebody whispers. \"Up, up, up,\" whispers the arch."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/arch_look/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:fbfe2f541d966356789391b9f33eee286bf037e67d09bfd277fe2b3e4ec18eee",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Water always finds the tallest door."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Which way?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "someone asks. \"Way, way, way,\" says the arch, not helping."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/arch_light/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:904f987eaf9644506a4128cd19acaeb2af62535080726ddda79edca4e20e0e9a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You hold the mosslight jar high, and its glow shows the roof's shape."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Pretty,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "someone says. \"Pretty, pretty,\" the arch agrees."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/jam/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:968641ac96d4dfe561d9997408aa91fda59f6a7946a60cfd6b594f8a3d1c4a80",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Ahead, a jam of tree trunks and ice is piled across the river, a spiky wall with water pouring through the gaps. Some trees still have their birds' nests."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"That was a forest on the bank yesterday,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry, landing on top."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"The river ate it in the night.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "How will you get past?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/jam_gap/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:970beb60ae7cd5c021fbb47fcd6a7c1e4edac8f159a0b27d0aac0bae07d5beed",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Gaps are the easy way. You decide to be as sensible as water."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"That gap!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry, pointing with her whole wing."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/jam_push/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:6cf746a096fe30943ebd2e04733efd18d12bd36a5c7d061835002721b24958f7",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The trunks are big, but a stiff rope can still push off a wall. Skerry hops along the top."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Push here! No, here!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/chute/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:b803d5009168c76ca40034370ac2e94e1b3c0ab0b36bb68a7ccfd6fe6dbf07bf",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The river squeezes between two walls of ice and runs fast. It roars like a crowd of cheerful giants."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Too narrow for wings!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls from far above."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll be at the bottom! Probably!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "How will you go through?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/chute_ride/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:80ef23e2e397b4cab66f0eca65fe1a659b4f11ddefd53bafb51df665b654879d",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Hold the rope high, and nobody gets pulled away."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Higher!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "someone shouts, and the walls shout it back."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/chute_steer/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:107c37a5c5463c099b52c8811e5e0db614f5c811ba95dc34f6bd3ae26060969f",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Walls are good for pushing off."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Boots out!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "someone yells. \"Boots out!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/chute_brace/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:ef540b14dc205206ba6d54bb8d391d24f0de0ff8e859bef3e8c6816da9880cd3",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A thornguard stands in front. Even on a river, that is the job."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Behind me,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "they say."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Everybody.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/slip/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:d4dda4e8accca6b70adc5a014836b5b5933b43a17293e986c4151c1352d5f01a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Out of the chute, the rope jerks. A hand has slipped. Somebody slides away down the line, eyes wide, still tied on."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Hold on!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shrieks, swooping low."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I see you! Hold on!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Everyone knows what to do."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/slip_haul/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:121a5b886052b21190d56f1678eb76de04ef334c1040504d872f1718eb801151",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Every hand on the rope can pull."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Pull!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "yells Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Pull pull pull!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/slip_swing/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:6fd1fbcfa8235446189766b41caa53267c15b2c294c9466c2e15af870436d858",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A rope can be a hand that reaches."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Swing it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll point!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/shiver/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:36214c8c4a1f211c6a3f3673d646497318e3692052b4cca26d259b0b10be622d",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Everyone is still shaking. Your teeth rattle like dice in a cup. A long bend lies ahead."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Sing!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Or paddle! Paddling gets you near the bank. Singing gets you warm. I can't do either for you!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "How will you keep going?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/shiver_eat/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:38d3abf85e48f99bc516155442893a0e94013bd5b3545176c4306ac43c6fcc5d",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You pass the food around, one small piece each. It tastes like being looked after."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Save me a crumb!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "calls Skerry. Warmth spreads to your toes, and the shivering gives up and goes home."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/shiver_sing/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:23aff049df9187887446af2f394cbe84a823f2e184a21d1991ab804dcf61764d",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "It does not have to be a good song. It has to be a long one, with a chorus to yell. Skerry yells it too."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Oh, the river is wet, and the river is wide!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "By the second chorus, the cold listens from far away."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/shiver_paddle/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:10d1537bf7cf1ff46e9fad95b76af5d7e800659bab0548df181fc57f1bbb2288",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Paddle, swap, paddle, swap. You take turns on the outside of the line, and the bank creeps closer."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Nearly in the slow lane!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls. Teeth still rattle, but the bank is right there now."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/goats/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:8467bb6a3e99f81d9df185c4c7f506ff43fd8e1914489de22de61196a00f25aa",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "On the bank above, snowhorn goats trot along, keeping pace with you. One bleats, loud for its size."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Wild ones,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Not the herder's. Goats know where the ground is firm, though.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "How will you use them?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/goats_watch/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:f9099029eef1af89c50b00cb12f8e219bf2d1cc91639d97c8077559249d1fd65",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A goat never puts a hoof down by accident."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Watch the big one,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"She's smug. Smug goats are always right.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/goats_follow/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:b55889eecbe2e9126f817e20808710e11a092a3def49d0bb37cf3c06137a5c70",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Following goats from a river is silly. It might just work."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Follow that goat!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry, delighted."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/ledge_ahead/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:4261265d4ed272178aad3de11a56a0f22111c6e21e66b43cfe6a2a8168f2c832",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "At the next bend, the east bank swells into a ledge of dark ice, like a thumb. A round knob of ice sticks up from its tip."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"There!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shouts."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"A goat path runs up from it to Frostfang!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The current carries you right at it, then right past. This may be your best chance out."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/aim/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:1848730528c60ce8b613b32292589b48dae309a4da9a443dee291941bacd3977",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The ledge is coming fast. Aim well, and you drift right beside it. Aim badly, and it passes you by like a bus that does not stop."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Steer!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Steer, steer, steer!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "How will you steer?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/aim_kick/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:80deef149d92bc969d37160bf7c8440737ce988cc3ca0d72865a285ae397466c",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Every boot can push. You steer like a very slow, very wet boat."
      },
      {
        "by": "party",
        "text": "\"Left boots!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "someone calls."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/aim_swing/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:93196db7b6db89e156b14427a0f16e255e0b54fc0d91e20ec4dcff4e9bb1e8e4",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A rope end in the water follows the current. Let the current steer."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Clever,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/aim_sky/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:b4717c9100c3fd77fd7cfd57cfd89393879a9faacbc66e46b265abe2f72a48af",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skyward lifts you above the water for a heartbeat."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Look!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls beside you."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Look fast!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/ledge/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:fbe2fb0d94212050b94bccc88652387d2d53a0efd62934336b7b4dcf0f6839e8",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The ledge is almost beside you. Its top is smooth, but a lip of ice sticks out above the water, and the knob stands on its tip. Skerry lands on the ledge and plants her feet."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I can't pull you,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "she says."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"But I can cheer.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Who makes a handhold while the others pull?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/grab/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:d73753283d3ffd8ccb8f80761c0e8f69d84a8775e98aeeb9de157eb3114268de",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The lip is smooth, cold and very close."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Reach!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry yells."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"All the way!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/hook/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:af808478106e7d30fb64fef489b73162be231ae0e4a1946eae8d540f20a5ea47",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A knob on a ledge is like a handle on a door."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Ring it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "calls Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Like a ring!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/smash/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:4e936bec4d39578afa4805ab5cd15d764c23c7061a112b8eba7a52c38cbecb3a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A lip of ice is just a barrier pretending to be a handle."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Smash it nicely,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/lift/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:0573ef34f04b8dae7bfeacbfa95b93cc8aa201d509cabdd5baf0bef52f97656d",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Wet wings are heavy, but they can still lift a rope."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Up, up!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls, flapping beside you."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/throw_loop/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:a87f1b29f2d7aec264ccaaa57fb8dce891cc6db00a6f6641dff7ed40e5713d39",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You tied this loop for a day like today. It is exactly knob-sized."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Now!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/ashore/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:bd2185140723849f736b683f648641c8b298ce4fe5677d1ed737484f4cc36dd8",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You scramble into the shallows under the ledge. Cold water pours out of your boots. Skerry lands and wraps her wings around as many of you as fit."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Everyone,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "she says."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Everyone, everyone.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You are on the east bank under Frostfang, far below the broken shelf."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/early/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:0b15bf84f2a83780429658192c65244f9d6751d5bcd7f4d9cbd911df154a4c53",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You sit on a new bank, wet and together. The cairned pass is still uphill."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll fly back and tell Orin where you came out,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry. She looks at the river."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Yesterday it took my road. Today it gave you a new one. Something is moving this river. What? And can it be put back?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Your chime still leans upstream, toward the glacier."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/tree/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:59dd5d46fdf7a2b4aa232b1c1c3022dd9220910b09f4f20cb7aae9052b0eaad5",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The ice thins as the river bends. An old tree leans from the east bank, its lowest branch dragging in the current. Skerry lands on the branch to hold it down. It dips. Then it bounces her off."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Not heavy enough!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "she says. Beyond it, dark boundary stones stand in the grass. You have to reach the branch together."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/tree_choice/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:41d1c68e909418a496b1d0b8ba64158446b5cea1e11d08e6e7be19fe8e8d5a84",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The branch dips within reach, then lifts. One missed grip could leave a friend behind."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Together,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Or not at all.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Keep the line between you, and pick your moment."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/climb/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:0f3f7a4afa1e60b6c610b4440e2325e7e24d15faa86570af91c68b70155d9bca",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The branch swings down and up, like a slow gate."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"On the dip!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Wait for it...\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/lasso/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:9335f69af1eb5294a938eeb3130556653e255f86610100873c70e2d5e36a34af",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A rope is for pulling. A branch is for being pulled to."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Throw it like you mean it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/lane/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:a901cbf53b9bbb30e4309fa255582e9c8dd613b1c7a0ad867aff9f5a22abce8a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You read this river up by the shelf, and it bends here the same way. The curl runs right under the branch."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"You learned it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Ride the curl!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/guide/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:faa50ae4ff5e167506a655837ecd01226cdae03da67e1b625433dc8779695151",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A kitsune can make a bright guide for every hand."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Ooh, sparkly,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Do mine next.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/call/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:13ece32b1c61516ec6d8b10a614d17a1eeacf6d174c2d853220ca14e2b129632",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A manticore's roar carries over any water."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Roar the moment!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll cover my ears!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/middle/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:45ce6eed36f7f86692becba804df1d92b72cf515e9d4a162af456353ab474a3e",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You sit among boundary stones in low hills called the Red Sky Foothills. The carvings show a mountain with a strange shape."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Never been this far down the river,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"The river brought you somewhere new.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "She shakes out her wings."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll tell Orin. Something is moving this river. What? Can it be put back?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "First you check on each other. Then you can study the stones."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rift/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:0193dccdc8d831c7a54fa2da448db54bf44939280c69b09a3e50e76f03fa4b5a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "A fold opens beside the current. Through it come thin cold air and a low, distant song. Dry ground seems to hang beyond the shimmer. Downriver, water breaks over pale rocks. The light around the fold is called Riftlight."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"What is that?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry cries."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I don't like it! I like it a little!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rift_choice/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:d8326f2f8ccf5fe490e8ac0f63152c5adf3afb9277de3e71186d700af594809a",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The opening is close enough to reach without dropping the line."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I can't follow you through that,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls, circling."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I don't fit, and I don't want to.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Will you test it, or keep looking for a shore?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/river_read/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:ddc8aeb9ed0e90098f1104289e63d5ab0f4552e3c5a587dbdfbccb200fdf612f",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Your starweaver studies the light around the fold and tells everyone what they see. To the rest of you, it is only a shimmer."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Well?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry. Thin air and a distant song are all anyone can learn."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rift_decision/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:4f5dbc1a5973a60542df2b2b6d68926dc077aa4882e364d1ba2d9eb2769dca53",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The fold is within reach. Beyond it lie dry ground and that low song. Downstream, the river still has a bank."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Your choice,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll tell Orin either way.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Which unknown will you take?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rift_end/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:7b0f347894e23985348eb83b874ad1356dd8131f6f049f493c6c4e6823304f87",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You angle the rope toward the fold and gather at its edge. Thin air brushes your faces."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Go together!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll tell Orin you went into the light!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Nobody has let go. You will go through all at once, together, somewhere none of you has ever been."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rapids/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:8040ac33ff8f440df48cfdd10a5360e6731c868ad778d52b278d2015c8d54f9f",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The river quickens around pale rocks. Downstream, a bridge spans the water, and a gravel bar runs along its east bank. A flat boat waits near the bridge, with a small frog in a big hat."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"A boat!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shouts."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"With a frog in it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Aim for the gravel, or call for help?"
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/swim/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:22f0cb18be92897c434f62061e059bc54a89b5ff05f05c15e4a2acd8afbaeb69",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Gravel is the nearest dry thing."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Swim!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Swim like a fish that's late!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/signal/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:c2bace3341987298fba1bbe501249346ca2294d9eca821e2a67b449ce3c9f1ef",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You wave and shout so the boatman sees you through the spray. Skerry shrieks too, very loud."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Over here! Frog! Frog with a hat!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/mend_signal/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:f2f454bc27acbbe759ed2ada2fd5a2b943131ca370748b333b193c1277b25b8b",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Mend warms the signaler's hands, so the wave is a big one."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Wave!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "says Skerry."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Bigger!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/late/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:f60eb9e66c27ccad5b11ea64b993a5f96f1da1863a49d355f69a4df988021522",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You climb onto the east bank beside a bridge called Ashspan Bridge. One of its spans is cracked. A frogfolk boatman nods from his flat boat."
      },
      {
        "by": "old_ossley",
        "text": "\"Old Ossley,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "he says. Long pause."
      },
      {
        "by": "old_ossley",
        "text": "\"Bridge is broken. Folk need ferrying. You could help, if you're staying.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry lands beside you."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll tell Orin. The river let you out somewhere new. Something is moving it. What? Can it be put back?\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rescue/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:d2687f1ea5bfe14d8bd56ccdd549645ca650eafe2aea7e0567f48fbb818214de",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The frog on the flat boat hooks your line with his pole. He helps every friend aboard and passes around a dry blanket."
      },
      {
        "by": "old_ossley",
        "text": "\"Old Ossley,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "he says. Long pause."
      },
      {
        "by": "old_ossley",
        "text": "\"I turn up when I am going your way.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry lands on the boat's edge and it tips."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Sorry,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "she says."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Sorry.\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/rescued/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:5e07668bd8c64dd791626d23171573c2feca0e81c179bcbbbb3dadbf61564f93",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Ossley brings the boat to the east bank beside a bridge called Ashspan Bridge. One span is cracked."
      },
      {
        "by": "old_ossley",
        "text": "\"Folk need ferrying,\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "he says."
      },
      {
        "by": "old_ossley",
        "text": "\"Bridge is broken.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "You share a supper bundle, warmer and together. Skerry shakes out her wings."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"I'll tell Orin. Something is moving this river. What? Can it be put back?\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The river changed your road. It did not end it."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/floe_hop/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:3dfe8f66502216a7c516104b0095404adaa30e56cd7d4b2f7d9479dd1fb1fd72",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Flat floes drift apart and together, toward a big, calm one."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Wait till they touch!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Then hop!\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/jam_hold/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:9b6ec90f13e2e0db655600b3a22dc1d01b9193e907363012b2c7447e44ec1417",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Past the jam, your rope's loop is snagged on a branch, and the branches shift and roll in the current."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Keep your eye on the loop!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Which branch has it?\""
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/knob_toss/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:72c6a1dcd3ad67d91b474202aa1615320b57f458e077b2ee56a39c9281047870",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The knob on the ledge's tip is just out of reach."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Toss a loop over it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Like Grumble! Like Old Clank!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Throw it as it comes by."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/haul_loop/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:6ad510f2feb91759d0104526684b73fabd4948ffbd321330ddce637c2ce844de",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The loop you hooked over the knob is holding. Everyone takes the line and pulls together."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Pull!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry cries. The river swings you all toward the shallows."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/drake_shallows/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:f55e6a557ad7f16bb009f8a69a342877a9794d08949d16d9c522252a559c225c",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Your boots scrape onto a gravel ford. In the shallows sits a young river drake, gray and bumpy as a wet stone."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Don't feed it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry calls."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"River drakes like to be paid in dropped food. This one thinks you're the toll.\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "It puffs up and splashes."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/drake_rescued/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:e60549edeb84c4a674fe80d98570d61c7bbe7d39efd4924191dfc5bbc2b27158",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "The drake wins the ford, loudly. A tail flick sweeps you back into the stream, and it keeps your rope's spare loop to chew."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Rude!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shouts at it."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Very rude!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Only your shins and your pride are bruised."
      }
    ]
  },
  "riftlight-headwaters-washout/grab_near/narration": {
    "source": "sha256:0e93f9b937f776b4feeb85a1ea16f1acaff1e517b40f46414249e03644e6f374",
    "reviewed": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "All that kicking put you right against the bank. The near lip is close enough to touch."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"Grab it!\""
      },
      {
        "by": "narrator",
        "text": "Skerry shouts."
      },
      {
        "by": "skerry",
        "text": "\"You earned that one!\""
      }
    ]
  }
}
